WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.571
How do I issue a sales invoice from the rep's phone in Field Sales?

2
00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:11.964
In the bottom bar, tap Customers, then tap Choose customer, type the customer's name, mobile or number, and pick them from the list.

3
00:00:12.867 --> 00:00:18.498
The customer card opens with their balance and credit limit. Tap the New invoice button to start the invoice.

4
00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:26.211
At the top of the invoice screen, choose the sale type, cash, credit or installments, depending on the permissions you have.

5
00:00:27.133 --> 00:00:33.844
Search for an item or tap its card in the grid. Each tap adds one more, and you can also scan the barcode with the camera.

6
00:00:34.767 --> 00:00:42.066
Tap Review and issue to check the items and quantities, then tap Issue invoice. The invoice appears and you can print it or share it.
